Scoped erosion video filter

The option table, pixel-format list, coordinate mask, per-plane threshold and
border semantics in src/video-ops/erosion.ts follow libavfilter/vf_neighbor.c
(erosion, config_input, filter_slice, filter_frame, pix_fmts and options).
